"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team uses every day.",
"char_start": 17,
"char_end": 74,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 20.58,
"end": 22.26,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 75,
"char_end": 96,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.26,
"end": 31.26,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we get into the topic, In\u00eas Carvalho was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 97,
"char_end": 243,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 31.26,
"end": 32.22,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 259,
"char_end": 272,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.28,
"end": 34.38,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 273,
"char_end": 326,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 34.38,
"end": 40.02,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 In\u00eas Carvalho mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 344,
"char_end": 437,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.02,
"end": 45.96,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 438,
"char_end": 536,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.32,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 537,
"char_end": 570,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 211.38,
"end": 214.32,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and have you revisited it?",
"char_start": 571,
"char_end": 630,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 214.32,
"end": 222.36,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "In short, most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 646,
"char_end": 783,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 222.42,
"end": 225.18,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 784,
"char_end": 842,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.24,
"end": 229.26,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 843,
"char_end": 915,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 229.26,
"end": 230.7,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "It's a useful framework.",
"char_start": 933,
"char_end": 957,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.76,
"end": 234.12,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 958,
"char_end": 1016,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 234.12,
"end": 234.78,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1032,
"char_end": 1052,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 234.84,
"end": 240.42,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1053,
"char_end": 1152,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 240.48,
"end": 244.56,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1153,
"char_end": 1221,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 244.56,
"end": 245.88,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1239,
"char_end": 1272,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 245.94,
"end": 250.2,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1273,
"char_end": 1344,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 250.2,
"end": 250.56,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1360,
"char_end": 1370,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 250.62,
"end": 256.5,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you will need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1371,
"char_end": 1476,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 256.56,
"end": 259.32,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1477,
"char_end": 1526,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 259.38,
"end": 263.4,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1527,
"char_end": 1600,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 263.4,
"end": 264.9,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tell me more about it.",
"char_start": 1618,
"char_end": 1640,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.9,
"end": 269.04,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1656,
"char_end": 1725,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 269.1,
"end": 272.28,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 1726,
"char_end": 1792,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 272.28,
"end": 274.2,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
"char_start": 1810,
"char_end": 1844,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 274.26,
"end": 276.84,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "How does the RockShox suspension system fit into this frame?",
"char_start": 1845,
"char_end": 1905,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 276.84,
"end": 277.2,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1921,
"char_end": 1931,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 277.26,
"end": 281.82,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 1932,
"char_end": 2008,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 281.88,
"end": 285.9,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2009,
"char_end": 2098,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 285.9,
"end": 286.8,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "You know what else?",
"char_start": 2116,
"char_end": 2135,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 286.86,
"end": 291.06,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I'll say it plainly: Linear manages my entire engineering operation.",
"char_start": 2136,
"char_end": 2204,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 291.12,
"end": 295.92,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is a task manager designed for speed \u2013 it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2205,
"char_end": 2279,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 295.98,
"end": 297.96,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2280,
"char_end": 2314,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.44,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That's a helpful context.",
"char_start": 2315,
"char_end": 2340,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.5,
"end": 844.86,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2341,
"char_end": 2399,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 844.86,
"end": 845.52,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2415,
"char_end": 2435,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 845.58,
"end": 852.54,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 2436,
"char_end": 2561,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 852.6,
"end": 854.94,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 2562,
"char_end": 2624,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 855.0,
"end": 858.18,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2625,
"char_end": 2694,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 858.18,
"end": 859.74,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 2712,
"char_end": 2739,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 859.8,
"end": 862.74,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and have you since changed your mind?",
"char_start": 2740,
"char_end": 2821,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 862.74,
"end": 869.1,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 2837,
"char_end": 2946,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 869.16,
"end": 873.48,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2947,
"char_end": 3014,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 873.48,
"end": 874.5,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3032,
"char_end": 3054,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 874.56,
"end": 877.5,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and what have you since learned or reconsidered?",
"char_start": 3055,
"char_end": 3136,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 877.5,
"end": 878.16,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3152,
"char_end": 3172,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 878.22,
"end": 884.1,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3173,
"char_end": 3267,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 884.16,
"end": 886.5,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3268,
"char_end": 3323,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 886.56,
"end": 890.88,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3324,
"char_end": 3390,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 890.88,
"end": 892.38,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3408,
"char_end": 3425,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 892.38,
"end": 901.8,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident. If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 3441,
"char_end": 3617,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 901.8,
"end": 902.82,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 3635,
"char_end": 3653,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 902.88,
"end": 907.2,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 3654,
"char_end": 3731,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 907.2,
"end": 907.86,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3747,
"char_end": 3767,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 907.92,
"end": 912.48,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 3768,
"char_end": 3844,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 912.54,
"end": 915.72,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3845,
"char_end": 3911,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1323.96,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 3929,
"char_end": 4012,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 1323.96,
"end": 1331.22,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the considerations surrounding risk management are relevant to everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4028,
"char_end": 4174,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 1331.22,
"end": 1332.78,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 4192,
"char_end": 4219,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 1332.84,
"end": 1336.44,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
