"char_start": 4220,
"char_end": 4285,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 1336.44,
"end": 1336.8,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 4301,
"char_end": 4311,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 1336.86,
"end": 1343.82,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 4312,
"char_end": 4445,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 1343.88,
"end": 1346.64,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 4446,
"char_end": 4504,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 1346.7,
"end": 1349.88,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4505,
"char_end": 4574,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 1349.88,
"end": 1351.32,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "It's a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 4592,
"char_end": 4618,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 1351.38,
"end": 1355.58,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4619,
"char_end": 4691,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 1355.58,
"end": 1362.24,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "In essence, a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your focus remains on the trail.",
